{"2411930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Axial Rift", "steam_appid": 2411930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axial Rift is a perspective‑shifting action‑adventure where you slice the voxel world in any direction to instantly transform isometric exploration into side‑scrolling platforming and combat.</strong> <strong>Both the game </strong><strong><i>and</i></strong><strong> the custom Rift Forge Engine powering it were built entirely solo over 7 years of development so far.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Side‑Scrolling Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive 2.5D combat featuring wall‑jumps, aerial attacks, dash strikes, combos, and special abilities — all designed around the slicing mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/b86d0cae508524298073a73d7754d657.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/b86d0cae508524298073a73d7754d657.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/b86d0cae508524298073a73d7754d657.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Paths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a passage is obscured by the overhead view, slice the world at the right angle to reveal secret rooms, alternate routes, and hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d450e4000e0be7fcceed2ba14436b1fc.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d450e4000e0be7fcceed2ba14436b1fc.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d450e4000e0be7fcceed2ba14436b1fc.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Layered Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate mazes, activate switches, unlock doors, and carve your own path through handcrafted voxel spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d3e1a06e7c131c53bb5b5b997e50f488.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d3e1a06e7c131c53bb5b5b997e50f488.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d3e1a06e7c131c53bb5b5b997e50f488.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attack Enemies Across Dimensions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to strike enemies in the background of a 2.5D game? Change the slice angle and bring them into your plane of attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi‑Perspective Boss Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights demand switching between overhead and side‑scrolling perspectives to counter attacks from any direction. Each perspective has strengths, master both to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Never Be Locked to One Perspective Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a jump looks unclear in isometric view, slice the world and switch to side‑scrolling for perfect depth and alignment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powered by the Rift Forge Engine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully custom engine built from the ground up — optimized for real‑time voxel slicing, high‑detail rendering, and ray‑traced lighting at high frame rates, even on budget iGPUs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/18f9aa1013a33eb8f384bd67b9b2866b.avif?t=1783018410\" width=512 height=256 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axial Rift is a perspective‑shifting action‑adventure where you slice the voxel world in any direction to instantly transform isometric exploration into side‑scrolling platforming and combat.</strong> <strong>Both the game </strong><strong><i>and</i></strong><strong> the custom Rift Forge Engine powering it were built entirely solo over 7 years of development so far.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Side‑Scrolling Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive 2.5D combat featuring wall‑jumps, aerial attacks, dash strikes, combos, and special abilities — all designed around the slicing mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/b86d0cae508524298073a73d7754d657.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/b86d0cae508524298073a73d7754d657.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/b86d0cae508524298073a73d7754d657.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Paths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a passage is obscured by the overhead view, slice the world at the right angle to reveal secret rooms, alternate routes, and hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d450e4000e0be7fcceed2ba14436b1fc.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d450e4000e0be7fcceed2ba14436b1fc.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d450e4000e0be7fcceed2ba14436b1fc.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Layered Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate mazes, activate switches, unlock doors, and carve your own path through handcrafted voxel spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d3e1a06e7c131c53bb5b5b997e50f488.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d3e1a06e7c131c53bb5b5b997e50f488.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/d3e1a06e7c131c53bb5b5b997e50f488.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attack Enemies Across Dimensions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to strike enemies in the background of a 2.5D game? Change the slice angle and bring them into your plane of attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi‑Perspective Boss Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights demand switching between overhead and side‑scrolling perspectives to counter attacks from any direction. Each perspective has strengths, master both to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Never Be Locked to One Perspective Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a jump looks unclear in isometric view, slice the world and switch to side‑scrolling for perfect depth and alignment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.poster.avif?t=1783018410\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.webm?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.mp4?t=1783018410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powered by the Rift Forge Engine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully custom engine built from the ground up — optimized for real‑time voxel slicing, high‑detail rendering, and ray‑traced lighting at high frame rates, even on budget iGPUs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/18f9aa1013a33eb8f384bd67b9b2866b.avif?t=1783018410\" width=512 height=256 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Slice the voxel world in any direction to shift instantly from isometric exploration to side‑scrolling action, unlocking new ways to solve puzzles, discover secrets, platform with precision, and outsmart bosses.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/e8e69a0175ddc1cb516ac811dbbe55bd2adb0c37/header.jpg?t=1783018410", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/b03cc9aeb9846e3525